TrustScore Atlas

Brand assets under app/static/brand (the TrustScore mark, wordmark and favicons) are the
TrustScore brand assets, copied unchanged from the TrustScore design tokens package
(packages/design-tokens/assets). Atlas is a TrustScore sub-brand. These assets are not covered
by the code licence of this repository and may not be reused to represent other products.

Boundaries under app/static/boundaries derive from the OCHA common operational datasets for
Uganda (COD-AB), CC BY-IGO, simplified with the pipeline's boundaries command.
